WEBVTT

00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:34.450
It's the end! Go, go, go!

00:00:35.530 --> 00:00:37.870
White body Mahato!

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:40.740
The spirit of defeat, the master's surrender!

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:44.840
If you start running, you'll run to Mahato!

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:50.700
To the goal of victory!

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:57.020
Go, go, go! Mahato, go! Go, go, go!

00:01:27.260 --> 00:01:27.740
Thank you for watching!

00:01:35.020 --> 00:01:37.830
Thank you for watching until the end.

00:02:00.730 --> 00:02:00.930
Thank you.

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:47.160
Isn't it amazing?

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:48.710
Thank you!

00:03:49.190 --> 00:03:50.750
Jim Clark is a loser, too.

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:56.230
Go, we're out of here.

00:03:56.270 --> 00:03:56.710
We're screwed.

00:03:57.770 --> 00:03:59.130
What a great racer!

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:03.510
Why don't you join the company team and become a pro racer?

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:05.990
Yeah, but...

00:04:05.990 --> 00:04:07.740
You can't join the Grand Prix race.

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:19.230
No. My father won't let me.

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:24.510
Your father is a knight in my company.

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:27.100
He'll understand if I ask him to.

00:04:27.760 --> 00:04:28.930
But...

00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:35.440
Goh, leave it to the director.

00:04:35.760 --> 00:04:38.650
Director, I really want to be a racer.

00:04:38.950 --> 00:04:40.510
I really want to be a racer.

00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:44.180
You have the ability to line up with the racers of the world.

00:04:45.560 --> 00:04:47.490
Don't be discouraged and do your best.

00:04:47.770 --> 00:04:48.960
Yes, please.

00:04:49.730 --> 00:04:51.980
Goh, fly this Mach 5.

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:53.350
All over the world.

00:04:53.710 --> 00:04:55.430
As expected of your father's design.

00:04:55.710 --> 00:04:56.370
It's going to work.

00:04:56.750 --> 00:04:59.910
My father is this Mach 5.

00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:00.830
I invented an engine with more than 100% performance.

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:11.210
I designed this engine with this in mind.

00:05:11.590 --> 00:05:13.500
What the engine needs is horsepower.

00:05:13.800 --> 00:05:15.180
Horsepower equals rotation.

00:05:15.720 --> 00:05:19.690
My GOV12 engine succeeded in raising the rotation to 30,000 rpm.

00:05:21.390 --> 00:05:22.310
What? 30,000?

00:05:22.370 --> 00:05:22.590
That's great.

00:05:23.030 --> 00:05:24.530
But in what way?

00:05:24.890 --> 00:05:29.970
For the development of my car, I used this GOV12 engine...

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:31.860
I'm absolutely against it!

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:35.660
I'll explain the G.O.V.12 engine from now on.

00:05:37.090 --> 00:05:38.110
There's a lot to explain!

00:05:38.700 --> 00:05:41.700
What? You don't have to explain! Stop it!

00:05:43.140 --> 00:05:44.540
I know what you're talking about, you moron!

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:45.800
What did you say?!

00:05:46.180 --> 00:05:46.900
Mifune-kun!

00:05:47.590 --> 00:05:47.830
Yes!

00:05:48.230 --> 00:05:48.370
Yes!

00:05:48.650 --> 00:05:49.450
Onimura-kun!

00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:50.760
Calm down, Onimura!

00:05:52.420 --> 00:05:54.580
But, sir, I'm also a member of this company.

00:05:55.530 --> 00:05:56.370
I'd like to have a word with you.

00:05:57.540 --> 00:05:59.960
The engine that Mr. Mifune invented is actually...

00:06:00.800 --> 00:06:04.460
What? Don't look at my design and what are you going to say?

00:06:04.710 --> 00:06:06.110
You don't have to look at that.

00:06:06.230 --> 00:06:09.320
The theory is great, but the engine is not even a toy.

00:06:09.740 --> 00:06:12.470
If you make something like that, it will be an embarrassment to our company.

00:06:13.420 --> 00:06:15.900
President, please. First of all, please test the first one.

00:06:16.920 --> 00:06:19.710
But if there is no one's approval, we can't test it.

00:06:20.370 --> 00:06:24.020
Do you think the company will be able to spend a lot of money on your play?

00:06:25.050 --> 00:06:27.660
All right, I'm counting on you.

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:28.970
Are you guys here?

00:06:30.440 --> 00:06:30.900
That's how it's supposed to be!

00:06:31.790 --> 00:06:33.870
You can do whatever you want with it.

00:06:34.030 --> 00:06:34.600
Are you kidding me?

00:06:34.880 --> 00:06:37.160
I'm the only one who has the power to complete the engine!

00:06:38.140 --> 00:06:55.670
I'm sorry, Dad.

00:06:55.870 --> 00:06:56.290
The results are bad.

00:06:56.550 --> 00:06:58.550
It looks like you.

00:06:58.850 --> 00:06:59.170
Huh?

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:02.480
Well, AbeKobe, there's a gift of parents, but...

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:03.200
You're the king of the devil,

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:03.840
I'm so scared.

00:07:05.610 --> 00:07:06.570
I'm not going to go out.

00:07:06.770 --> 00:07:07.570
I'm not going to go out.

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:08.390
Is this the company's money?

00:07:08.970 --> 00:07:09.410
What?

00:07:10.070 --> 00:07:10.590
It's not related.

00:07:11.550 --> 00:07:11.930
But wait.

00:07:12.390 --> 00:07:13.870
How did my research have been complete?

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:14.930
I don't have trust.

00:07:15.510 --> 00:07:15.610
I don't have trust.

00:07:15.650 --> 00:07:16.290
I don't have trust as always as a father.

00:08:31.850 --> 00:08:31.970
What?

00:08:35.130 --> 00:08:35.450
What?

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:37.010
Wait!

00:08:41.990 --> 00:08:42.530
You have to get that bag!

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:30.380
Thank you for watching.

00:10:01.850 --> 00:10:07.000
Ah, Mitty! Mitty! Mitty!

00:10:07.360 --> 00:10:19.360
I'm going to take care of you.

00:10:19.440 --> 00:10:21.440
If you have a brother, I'll take care of you.

00:10:21.660 --> 00:10:22.700
Okay, hurry up!

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:25.440
I'm sorry, I'll take care of you. Go!

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:31.010
Let's go, Mom.

00:11:32.270 --> 00:11:33.110
Thank you, Michi.

00:11:33.530 --> 00:11:34.150
The bag is safe.

00:11:34.490 --> 00:11:36.050
How about I bring it to you?

00:11:36.270 --> 00:11:36.910
You don't have to call me.

00:11:37.190 --> 00:11:37.830
I'm an old man who doesn't like it.

00:11:38.770 --> 00:11:39.130
Hahaha.

00:11:39.530 --> 00:11:51.250
If you want a blueprint,

00:11:51.490 --> 00:11:53.510
then my invention is worth it.

00:11:54.010 --> 00:11:54.970
Isn't that right, Mom?

00:11:55.350 --> 00:11:56.190
That's right.

00:11:56.450 --> 00:11:57.040
But what are you going to do

00:11:57.040 --> 00:11:57.980
if you quit the company?

00:12:00.500 --> 00:12:02.020
Why don't you renovate this house and start a maintenance factory?

00:12:04.550 --> 00:12:05.210
Good idea!

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:07.400
Mom, don't go! I have work to do!

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:12.130
All right! I'm going to complete the G.O.V.12 engine and make the whole world scream!

00:12:13.470 --> 00:12:14.790
I'm so happy!

00:12:15.410 --> 00:12:16.790
But what are you going to do with the production budget?

00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:19.340
Oh, I see.

00:12:20.600 --> 00:12:22.880
I'm sure you'll be able to do it if you work hard.

00:12:23.540 --> 00:12:24.820
That's right. There's no need to be pessimistic.

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:26.700
It's not that easy to make.

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:28.580
I guess I can't do it.

00:12:37.290 --> 00:12:38.310
I'll give you a treat, so don't cry.

00:12:43.840 --> 00:12:45.340
I'm so tired of crying!

00:12:46.560 --> 00:12:48.100
Idiot!

00:12:48.380 --> 00:12:50.990
Do you think you can get away with this?

00:12:50.990 --> 00:12:53.590
I'm sorry. He's a very strong guy.

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:55.190
Besides, he's very annoying.

00:12:55.730 --> 00:12:58.340
Shut up! You're making a lot of excuses.

00:13:00.030 --> 00:13:01.350
Ha ha ha ha ha ha.

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:04.880
I didn't think I'd be of any use to a kid like you.

00:13:05.480 --> 00:13:06.320
Why don't you give me 5 million?

00:13:07.080 --> 00:13:08.560
It seems like it's my turn.

00:13:09.160 --> 00:13:10.860
What? 5 million?

00:13:11.320 --> 00:13:11.880
Yeah.

00:13:12.310 --> 00:13:13.640
It's Mr. Black, whom I've known for a long time.

00:13:14.420 --> 00:13:15.560
If you don't want it, I don't mind.

00:13:16.150 --> 00:13:19.070
If I make the design of Daisuke Mikune my specialty,

00:13:19.530 --> 00:13:20.670
I'll get a lot of money.

00:13:22.020 --> 00:13:23.650
All right, I'll do it.

00:13:24.010 --> 00:13:25.170
Leave the design to me.

00:13:26.090 --> 00:13:28.110
I'll give up on becoming a pro racer.

00:13:28.770 --> 00:13:29.800
I'll do my best.

00:13:30.320 --> 00:13:30.940
I have to make up for my father's hard work.

00:13:31.880 --> 00:13:49.200
Good morning, Sub.

00:13:49.400 --> 00:13:50.340
Hey, Go.

00:13:50.560 --> 00:13:52.340
Go, you're going to make it, right?

00:13:52.460 --> 00:13:53.290
It's all thanks to me.

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:53.940
Yeah.

00:13:54.120 --> 00:13:55.230
The engine is a V8.

00:13:55.370 --> 00:13:56.070
It's very powerful.

00:13:57.340 --> 00:13:58.500
Hey, what's wrong with you?

00:13:58.580 --> 00:13:59.020
You look so pale.

00:14:00.600 --> 00:14:01.640
Sabu, please sell my car.

00:14:02.430 --> 00:14:03.410
What? You want to buy my car?

00:14:03.910 --> 00:14:04.310
Yes.

00:14:05.620 --> 00:14:06.460
You're so stupid, Go.

00:14:06.620 --> 00:14:08.700
I'm not against your father becoming a pro racer.

00:14:09.580 --> 00:14:11.110
That's not it. I want money.

00:14:12.270 --> 00:14:12.670
Money?

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:14.390
Go, you stink of water.

00:14:14.550 --> 00:14:15.250
Let go of me.

00:14:15.670 --> 00:14:17.050
Yes, I need money to build the engine.

00:14:17.610 --> 00:14:18.140
I see.

00:14:18.440 --> 00:14:20.820
You're a father, so I know how you feel.

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:22.230
I've made up my mind. Please.

00:14:22.590 --> 00:14:23.430
But...

00:14:23.930 --> 00:14:25.490
Hey, look at this.

00:14:25.650 --> 00:14:27.500
Tsurugiyama Trial Race.

00:14:27.600 --> 00:14:28.420
5 million yen.

00:14:28.520 --> 00:14:28.720
Wow!

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:31.040
Why don't you try it, Go?

00:14:31.920 --> 00:14:34.180
No way. My father is overheating all the time.

00:14:34.420 --> 00:14:36.280
But Mahago is better than me.

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:38.170
All right, let's do it.

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:41.420
It's decided. Tsurugi-yama is a difficult course, so we have to maintain Mahago.

00:14:42.660 --> 00:14:43.980
Well, leave it to me.

00:14:44.240 --> 00:14:45.140
I'm counting on you, Sam.

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:46.030
It's okay.

00:14:46.410 --> 00:14:54.650
What the hell are you doing? Knock it off!

00:14:55.150 --> 00:14:56.830
Oh, excuse me.

00:14:56.970 --> 00:14:59.250
The design of the G.O.V. 12 engine.

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:02.100
Who the hell are you?

00:15:02.100 --> 00:15:03.620
I am Black.

00:15:03.860 --> 00:15:04.700
Here's the money.

00:15:05.280 --> 00:15:06.230
I refuse!

00:15:08.080 --> 00:15:08.560
Fine.

00:15:09.140 --> 00:15:10.580
I don't want to waste my time.

00:15:11.360 --> 00:15:12.460
I'll let you have it.

00:15:13.910 --> 00:15:24.410
Now, where did you hide it?

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:25.580
Let me have it!

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:36.060
I'm going to go out again.

00:15:36.560 --> 00:15:36.940
Who?

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:40.090
I'm here to steal the blueprint.

00:15:41.050 --> 00:15:42.770
It's a ugly guy with a sword.

00:15:42.770 --> 00:15:43.730
All right.

00:15:43.930 --> 00:15:44.230
Go!

00:15:45.260 --> 00:15:46.080
Leave it alone!

00:15:46.600 --> 00:15:59.910
The wind is blowing.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:01.040
I can't believe you wrote it on the glass.

00:16:01.220 --> 00:16:02.620
Even the Buddha wouldn't notice.

00:16:04.680 --> 00:16:10.400
Okay, it's finally done.

00:16:10.760 --> 00:16:12.520
I put a lot of energy into it to make it in time for the race.

00:16:12.900 --> 00:16:14.310
Now, it's time for the modification test.

00:16:14.510 --> 00:16:14.770
I'm going to fly it.

00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:24.540
The lap time is 1 minute 31 seconds and 2 seconds.

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:25.060
That's amazing.

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:27.820
The driver is good.

00:16:28.180 --> 00:16:29.730
Hey, hey, the car is good too.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:30.460
I want you to go to the race.

00:16:30.460 --> 00:16:31.700
I'm sure you'll win the race.

00:16:32.120 --> 00:16:32.600
The race?

00:16:33.720 --> 00:16:34.760
No, I mean,

00:16:35.160 --> 00:16:36.320
I don't care which race you're in.

00:16:37.340 --> 00:16:57.520
It's Genzo.

00:16:57.740 --> 00:16:58.340
Genzo?

00:16:58.480 --> 00:16:58.880
Yes.

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:00.540
You can't even put it on the windscreen.

00:17:01.360 --> 00:17:02.400
No matter which train it is, it's all dirty.

00:17:43.600 --> 00:17:44.000
Are you okay?

00:17:45.640 --> 00:17:48.160
Are you okay?

00:17:53.620 --> 00:17:54.320
Hey, Genzo!

00:17:54.500 --> 00:17:56.220
You can't go to the race with this, you idiot!

00:17:56.500 --> 00:17:57.950
You were going to go to the Tsurugiyama race?

00:17:58.950 --> 00:17:59.450
How funny!

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:00.340
Sabu!

00:18:00.340 --> 00:18:01.060
Oh, no!

00:18:01.720 --> 00:18:03.320
Go, you can't beat me in that car!

00:18:03.500 --> 00:18:04.600
If you win, you'll have to go to Tsurumiya!

00:18:04.900 --> 00:18:05.380
Got it?

00:18:05.900 --> 00:18:08.880
Tsurumiya?

00:18:11.650 --> 00:18:11.930
Idiot!

00:18:11.950 --> 00:18:13.120
It's a secret from your father!

00:18:13.560 --> 00:18:15.780
Your father's engine money is worth a fortune, Go!

00:18:16.100 --> 00:18:16.480
Really?

00:18:17.220 --> 00:18:17.560
Okay!

00:18:17.980 --> 00:18:19.120
I'll say it myself!

00:18:19.900 --> 00:18:20.900
You don't have to say it!

00:18:22.680 --> 00:18:23.060
There!

00:18:29.340 --> 00:18:29.800
It's done!

00:18:38.510 --> 00:18:44.960
Okay, this Daishikeshi belt tire can run on deserts and mountain roads without slipping.

00:18:46.340 --> 00:18:49.080
Oh, no, there's no windscreen.

00:18:49.700 --> 00:18:52.900
Oh, I see. I forgot about the windscreen because I was too absorbed in it.

00:18:53.660 --> 00:18:55.500
Hey, we have to hurry up or we won't make it to the race.

00:18:55.760 --> 00:18:57.370
It can't be helped. Let's run without the windscreen.

00:18:57.930 --> 00:18:59.580
Don't be reckless. You're weak.

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:05.370
Oh, that's a good one, Kuriboh.

00:19:05.590 --> 00:19:07.780
I'm not kidding. This is my father's.

00:19:08.140 --> 00:19:09.970
I don't care. I don't care.

00:19:10.010 --> 00:19:11.610
Leave it to me.

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:15.920
Are you looking for a boat?

00:19:16.420 --> 00:19:18.790
I'm going to borrow a little wind turbine.

00:19:19.780 --> 00:19:21.980
Where's Go?

00:19:23.180 --> 00:19:29.680
I'm short-tempered.

00:19:40.300 --> 00:19:42.100
Hohohoho! Even though I drew it with transparent ink,

00:19:42.940 --> 00:19:45.040
if it breaks, it's all over!

00:19:45.770 --> 00:19:48.920
You thought well of hiding the blueprint in the windscreen.

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:50.180
I'll take it with the car I borrowed.

00:19:51.700 --> 00:19:52.440
This guy!

00:20:13.530 --> 00:20:14.990
It's my turn now. I'll take 5 million yen.

00:20:15.630 --> 00:20:16.490
You're not going to lose!

00:20:20.370 --> 00:20:23.620
I'll tell you the grid position.

00:20:24.620 --> 00:20:26.620
No. 1, No. 2, Inazuma.

00:20:26.880 --> 00:20:28.200
Driver, Sakai Genzo.

00:20:28.600 --> 00:20:29.900
No. 2, No. 3...

00:20:30.030 --> 00:20:32.450
No. 5, Mahago. Driver, Mifune Gou.

00:20:32.930 --> 00:20:36.190
No. 3, Zekken. No. 3, Lotus. Driver, Hirose Tadashi.

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:07.580
The more people come, the harder it is for them to understand!

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:08.530
Idiot!

00:21:32.120 --> 00:21:32.800
Get on it just

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:25.760
That's all

00:22:42.070 --> 00:22:42.330
That's it!

00:23:31.110 --> 00:23:31.270
Ah!

00:23:39.020 --> 00:23:39.400
Thank you for watching.

00:23:39.970 --> 00:23:40.970
Looks like he got in the way.

00:23:42.630 --> 00:23:43.110
I don't want to lose my precious car!

00:24:01.150 --> 00:24:01.910
So, stop the car.

00:24:02.310 --> 00:24:03.330
There's no life in your命.

00:24:03.930 --> 00:24:04.910
Ah, you are?

00:24:05.110 --> 00:24:11.500
So, I'll give you that glass of fire.

00:24:13.030 --> 00:24:14.650
I'll send you to the hell.

00:24:15.190 --> 00:24:15.980
That's right.

00:24:16.590 --> 00:24:17.950
Father, you're going to take the glass of fire.

00:24:18.210 --> 00:24:19.400
You're going to take it!

00:24:20.000 --> 00:24:22.810
I've said it well.

00:24:23.350 --> 00:24:23.810
Ah!

00:24:34.280 --> 00:24:34.740
Alright, let's go!

00:24:35.690 --> 00:24:35.890
Hey!

00:24:36.710 --> 00:24:36.910
GO!

00:25:34.020 --> 00:25:34.400
You
